on-list'&gt;BC Partners 收购 GSE 体育经纪公司，高尔夫球手德尚博也在其中&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：BC Partners Buys GSE Sport Agency With Golfer DeChambeau on List&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/bc-partners-buys-gse-sport-agency-with-golfer-dechambeau-on-list</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:01:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 股市崩盘蔓延至不太可能的市场，套利交易陷入困境</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade</link><description>华尔街 2026 年最可靠的押注之一正开始失去其万无一失的地位。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade'&gt;股市崩盘蔓延至不太可能的市场，套利交易陷入困境&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Meltdown Spills Into Unlikely Market, Sinking Carry Trade&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:01:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 爱荷华州爆炸的陆军地图可能低估了影响</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/army-detonation-emissions-maps-risk-underestimated.html</link><description>陆军官员计算的紧急排放情景并未按照环境保护局的要求使用“最坏情况情景”。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/army-detonation-emissions-maps-risk-underestimated.html'&gt;爱荷华州爆炸的陆军地图可能低估了影响&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Army’s Maps of Iowa Explosion May Underestimate Impact&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/army-detonation-emissions-maps-risk-underestimated.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:02:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 纽约市私立学校将购买破产同行以前拥有的农场</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nyc