a? Ask the Supreme Court.&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/why-arent-the-midterms-over-in-louisiana-ask-the-supreme-court.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:00:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 房屋建筑商股票在经历 2008 年以来最长的暴跌后仍将持续困境</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/homebuilder-stock-woes-to-persist-after-longest-slump-since-2008</link><description>房屋建筑商即将迎来一个不祥的市场里程碑，该集团的股价将连续三年下跌，这是自次贷危机导致全球金融危机以来最长的一次下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/homebuilder-stock-woes-to-persist-after-longest-slump-since-2008'&gt;房屋建筑商股票在经历 2008 年以来最长的暴跌后仍将持续困境&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Homebuilder Stock Woes to Persist After Longest Slump Since 2008&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/homebuilder-stock-woes-to-persist-after-longest-slump-since-2008</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:01:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 银行为 CVC 可能收购 Verisure 提供 110 亿欧元债务</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/banks-pitch-cvc-11-billion-debt-for-possible-verisure-takeover</link><description>银行正在向 CVC Capital Partners Plc 提供高达 110 亿欧元（合 120 亿美元）的债务融资，用于收购 Verisure Plc，因为这家收购公司在经历了公开市场艰难的一年后，正在考虑将家庭安全集团重新归私人所有。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/banks-pitch-cvc-11-billion-debt-for-possible-verisure-takeover'&gt;银行为 CVC 可能收购 Verisure 提供 110 亿欧元债务&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Banks Pitch CVC €11 Billion Debt for Possible Verisure Takeover&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/banks-pitch-cvc-11-billion-debt-for-possible-verisure-takeover</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:07:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item