erg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/air-india-chief-seeks-to-cut-650-million-in-costs-this-year</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:20:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 双线资本 (DoubleLine) 的科恩 (Cohen) 在遭遇 AI 债务抛售后，从憎恨者转变为热爱人工智能债务的人</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/doubleline-s-cohen-turns-ai-debt-lover-from-hater-after-selloff</link><description>人工智能债务已经变得足够便宜，足以吸引双线资本的罗伯特·科恩，他曾警告该行业可能存在泡沫。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/doubleline-s-cohen-turns-ai-debt-lover-from-hater-after-selloff'&gt;双线资本 (DoubleLine) 的科恩 (Cohen) 在遭遇 AI 债务抛售后，从憎恨者转变为热爱人工智能债务的人&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：DoubleLine’s Cohen Turns AI Debt Lover From Hater After Selloff&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/doubleline-s-cohen-turns-ai-debt-lover-from-hater-after-selloff</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:27:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 迪拜银行合并将打造 1,590 亿美元的伊斯兰贷款巨头</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dubai-bank-merger-to-create-159-billion-islamic-lending-giant</link><description>迪拜伊斯兰银行 PJSC 表示，它将收购阿联酋伊斯兰银行 PJSC，该交易将创建世界上最大的上市伊斯兰银行集团之一，资产约为 1,590 亿美元。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dubai-bank-merger-to-create-159-billion-islamic-lending-giant'&gt;迪拜银行合并将打造 1,590 亿美元的伊斯兰贷款巨头&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Dubai Bank Merger to Create $159 Billion Islamic Lending Giant&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dubai-bank-merger-to-create-159-billion-islamic-lending-giant</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:48:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 哈塞特看到了“金发姑娘”经济</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/hassett-sees-a-goldilocks-economy-video</link><description>白宫经济顾问凯文·哈塞特表示，强劲的投资和增长表明经济处于“金发姑娘”状态，通胀并未加速。他还对美联储政策、英伟达的国家重要性以及即将举行的丽莎库克听证会发表了看法。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/hassett-sees-a-goldilocks-economy-video'&gt;哈塞特看到了“金发姑娘”经济&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Hassett Sees a “Goldilocks” Economy&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/hassett-sees-a-goldilocks-economy-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:49:47 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[金融时报] 美国GDP数据升级使美联储12月加息发挥作用</title><link>https://www.ft.com/content/a1aaf5be-176c-4c4c-99d6-00875f6933f3?syn-25a6b1a6=1</link><description>经济分析局表示，第三季度经济年化增长率为 4.3%，高于最初预测的 3.4%&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/a1aaf5be-176c-4c4c-99d6-00875f6933f3?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;美国GDP数据升级使美联储12月加息发挥作用&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Upgrade to US GDP figures keeps December rate rise in play for Fed&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ft.com/content/a1aaf5be-176c-4c4c-99d6-00875f6933f3?syn-25a6b1a6=1</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:07:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 欧洲柴油需求将降至新冠水平以下</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/europe-diesel-demand-on-course-to-fall-below-covid-levels</link><description>今年欧洲的柴油需求肯定会低于新冠大流行期间，这表明伊朗战争正在打击石油消费并挤压消费者的钱包。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/europe-diesel-demand-on-course-to-fall-below-covid-levels'&gt;欧洲柴油需求将降至新冠水平以下&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Europe Diesel Demand on Course to Fall Below Covid Levels&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/europe-diesel-demand-on-course-to-fall-below-covid-levels</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:13:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] The RealReal 首席执行官看到转售的结构转变</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/the-realreal-ceo-sees-resale-s-structural-shift-video</link><description>数据显示，十月份消费者支出陷入停滞。 RealReal 首席执行官 Rati Sahi Levesque 加入 Bloomberg Open Interest，谈论她所看到的以及购物者如何转向转售以获取价值。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/the-realreal-ceo-sees-resale-s-structural-shift-video'&gt;The RealReal 首席执行官看到转售的结构转变&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：The RealReal CEO Sees Resale’s Structural Shift&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/the-realreal-ceo-sees-resale-s-structural-shift-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:15:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 10 月份核心 PCE 势头依然强劲</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/core-pce-momentum-remained-elevated-in-october-video</link><description>美国消费者支出在今年早些时候激增后，于 10 月份陷入停滞，这表明家庭在进入假期季节时稍作喘息。根据周三公布的经济分析局数据，经通胀调整后的个人支出与一个月前相比几乎没有变化。加拿大皇家银行美国高级经济学家迈克·里德对通胀数据做出反应。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/core-pce-momentum-remained-elevated-in-october-video'&gt;10 月份核心 PCE 势头依然强劲&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Core PCE Momentum Remained Elevated in October&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/core-pce-momentum-remained-elevated-in-october-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:19:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 华盛顿再次变蓝，企业监管加强</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/corporate-america-democrats.html</link><description>经过两年的放松管制后，由民主党领导的国会委员会将把聚光灯重新聚焦到美国企业界。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/corporate-america-democrats.html'&gt;华盛顿再次变蓝，企业监管加强&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Corporate Oversight Revs Up as Washington Turns Blue Again&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/corporate-america-democrats.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:27:37 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 雷斯塔称，俄罗斯炼油厂运行跌至数十年来最低水平</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russian-refinery-runs-plunge-to-lowest-in-decades-rystad-says</link><description>Rystad Energy表示，随着乌克兰继续袭击炼油厂，俄罗斯的石油加工率已降至二十多年来的最低水平，给该国国内燃料供应带来压力。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russian-refinery-runs-plunge-to-lowest-in-decades-rystad-says'&gt;雷斯塔称，俄罗斯炼油厂运行跌至数十年来最低水平&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Russian Refinery Runs Plunge to Lowest in Decades, Rystad Says&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russian-refinery-runs-plunge-to-lowest-in-decades-rystad-says</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:38:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 随着人工智能担忧加剧，CoreWeave 和 Nvidia 信用风险创下新高</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-nvidia-credit-risk-hit-fresh-highs-as-ai-fears-mount</link><description>CoreWeave Inc. 和 Nvidia Corp. 的信用风险指标周三创下历史新高，同时，随着华尔街对科技行业为人工智能融资而创纪录的借贷越来越担忧，人们的担忧情绪再次达到 3 月份的水平。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-nvidia-credit-risk-hit-fresh-highs-as-ai-fears-mount'&gt;随着人工智能担忧加剧，CoreWeave 和 Nvidia 信用风险创下新高&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：CoreWeave, Nvidia Credit Risk Hit Fresh Highs as AI Fears Mount&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-nvidia-credit-risk-hit-fresh-highs-as-ai-fears-mount</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:44:02 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] Anthropic 首次公开募股后的困境与 SpaceX 的早期形成鲜明对比</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/anthropic-s-post-ipo-struggles-contrast-with-spacex-s-early-days</link><description>Anthropic PBC 正在经历比 SpaceX 更艰难的上市进程，在这家克劳德开发商明年初首次作为上市公司发布报告之前，一系列市场和技术因素可能会拖累其股票表现。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/anthropic-s-post-ipo-struggles-contrast-with-spacex-s-early-days'&gt;Anthropic 首次公开募股后的困境与 SpaceX 的早期形成鲜明对比&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anthropic’s Post-IPO Struggles Contrast With SpaceX’s Early Days&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/anthropic-s-post-ipo-struggles-contrast-with-spacex-s-early-days</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:45:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 秘鲁力争在年底前解决非正式采矿纠纷</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/peru-races-to-resolve-informal-mining-fight-by-year-end-deadline</link><description>秘鲁正在竞相在年底截止日期前彻底修改管理数以万计的非正规采矿者的规定，政府警告说，否则可能会在一夜之间将他们推向非法状态。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/peru-races-to-resolve-informal-mining-fight-by-year-end-deadline'&gt;秘鲁力争在年底前解决非正式采矿纠纷&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Peru Races to Resolve Informal Mining Fight by Year-End Deadline&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/peru-races-to-resolve-informal-mining-fight-by-year-end-deadline</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:55:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 萨尔瓦多终于从打击帮派中获得经济收益</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/el-salvador-finally-reaps-economic-gains-from-gang-crackdown</link><description>萨尔瓦多的经济命运终于开始与其安全状况的显着改善相匹配。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/el-salvador-finally-reaps-economic-gains-from-gang-crackdown'&gt;萨尔瓦多终于从打击帮派中获得经济收益&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：El Salvador Finally Reaps Economic Gains From Gang Crackdown&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/el-salvador-finally-reaps-economic-gains-from-gang-crackdown</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:55:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 美国陆军引爆爱荷华州米德尔敦的爆炸物储藏室</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/us-army-detonates-explosives-cache-in-middletown-iowa-video</link><description>美国陆军炸毁了储存在爱荷华州一处设施中的五吨危险材料，早期迹象表明规划者已经避免了出现大量有毒铅云的最坏情况。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/us-army-detonates-explosives-cache-in-middletown-iowa-video'&gt;美国陆军引爆爱荷华州米德尔敦的爆炸物储藏室&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Army Detonates Explosives Cache in Middletown, Iowa&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/us-army-detonates-explosives-cache-in-middletown-iowa-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:11:46 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>